        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakamutumina boonse balanda bangu basinsimi, ndasungwaala kubatuma, ndati, Amuleke umwi aumwi inzila yakwe yabubi, amubotye milimo yanu, mutatobeli baleza bambi akubamanina milimo, lino munookalilila mpoonya awo anyika njindakamupa, nywebo abamausowanu. Nekubaboobo tamuna kucenjeka matwi aanu, tamuna kundiswiilila pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana ba-Jonadabu mwana wa-Rekabu bazuzikizya mulazyo wawisaabo ngwaakabalailila, pele bantu aba tabaswiilili ndime pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
